BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wellness Collective Moab": "https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wellness_collective
URL:https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar
SUMMARY:Monthly Ayurveda Talk- Dinacharya
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260612T190000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260612T200000
UID:74a0be30f02a7556f9ad7cd88a6fa344@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Kathy for an introduction to Dinacharya\, the Ayurvedic p
 ractice of daily routine and rhythm. Rooted in a holistic system practiced
  for thousands of years\, Ayurveda offers practical tools to support diges
 tion\, sleep\, nervous system regulation\, energy\, and overall well-being
  through simple daily habits. In this workshop\, we’ll explore the Ayurv
 edic clock and how different times of day may influence energy\, rest\, fo
 cus\, digestion\, and mood. Together\, we’ll discuss supportive self-car
 e practices grounded in Ayurvedic wisdom and reflect on how these traditio
 ns can be adapted in realistic\, accessible ways in modern life. This work
 shop is intended to be educational\, reflective\, and approachable for any
 one curious about building more awareness and intention into their daily r
 outines. No prior experience with Ayurveda is needed. By Donation- Suggest
 ed $15-$25
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532\, USA
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
