BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wellness Collective Moab": "https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wellness_collective
URL:https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar
SUMMARY:Community Drum Circle
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260614T173000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260614T200000
UID:ac7f02ba25b1ef1a1e96d549cf4560db@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Andrew and Monica of Drumming Sounds for a 90-minute inte
 ractive\, evidence-based group drumming experience at the Moab Arts and Re
 creation Center. By donation. Through guided rhythm activities\, participa
 nts are invited into connection\, creativity\, and collective expression. 
 Rooted in over 20 years of facilitation experience\, Drumming Sounds creat
 es opportunities for people to engage with rhythm in a way that is partici
 patory\, energizing\, and community-centered. This experience is designed 
 for all ages and experience levels. Whether you have been playing music fo
 r years or have never picked up a drum\, you’ll be invited to contribute
  to a shared rhythm experience that is created together in real time. No m
 usical background is required—just a willingness to join the circle and 
 experience the power of community rhythm. All ages welcome.
LOCATION:Moab Arts & Recreation Center\, 111 E 100 N\, Moab\, UT 84532\, U
 SA
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE-URLS:{"Wellness Collective Moab": "https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar"}
X-SOURCE-ID:wellness_collective
URL:https://wellnesscollectivemoab.com/calendar
SUMMARY:Chair Yoga with Breann
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260615T090000
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260615T100000
UID:558ace2906c18b9877c7a369ec08c256@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Chair Yoga – Mondays at 9 AM Join us every Monday morning at
  9:00 AM for a gentle and accessible Chair Yoga class\, led by Breann\, a 
 certified trauma-sensitive yoga teacher and experienced massage therapist.
  Breann brings over 20 years of experience in guiding others toward greate
 r body awareness\, healing\, and relaxation. This class is designed for ev
 eryone – whether you are new to yoga\, have limited mobility\, or are lo
 oking for a mindful and soothing way to start your week. Chair Yoga allows
  you to experience the benefits of yoga without needing to get down on a m
 at. What to Expect: • Seated and standing postures using the chair for s
 upport • Gentle stretches to enhance flexibility • Breathing exercises
  to calm the mind and body • Movements to promote better circulation and
  balance ✨ No experience necessary – come as you are! Where: Wellness 
 Collective When: Every Monday at 9:00 AM Cost: By donation Let this practi
 ce be a moment of self-care and grounding in your week.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
