SUMMARY:Take Care Tuesday- Yin & Sound w/Kylie
DTSTART;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260623T171500
DTEND;TZID=MDT;VALUE=DATE-TIME:20260623T184500
UID:420845c63a379d6f674dc7c97a71d205@wellnesscollectivemoab.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Take Care Tuesday with Kylie\, featuring
  a deeply relaxing evening of yin yoga\, sound healing\, and tea ceremony.
  This gentle class invites you to slow down\, settle into longer-held post
 ures\, and create space for rest and reflection. The practice will be pair
 ed with a soothing sound bath designed to support relaxation and ease\, an
 d a tea ceremony. A calming midweek offering for anyone seeking a softer p
 ace and a little extra care. No experience needed.
LOCATION:Wellness Collective\, 76 S 100 W\, Moab\, UT 84532
X-SOURCE:Wellness Collective Moab
END:VEVENT
